## Lesson Evaluation & Satisfaction Surveys (v2.1)

A new bidirectional feedback system has been implemented to track lesson quality and student progress more effectively.

### New Features:
- **Teacher Evaluations**: Teachers can mark lessons as `Passed`, `Continue`, or `Repeat` and leave specific notes for the student/parent.
- **Student Surveys**: Students can rate each lesson (1-5 stars) and provide feedback on their experience.
- **Status Badges**: Visual indicators on lesson cards show the current status at a glance.

