## Interactive Vocabulary & Speech (v3.0)
The vocabulary section in [week.html](file:///c:/Users/Deacjx/Documents/English%20code/_learning-plan/web/week.html) has been transformed into an interactive "Smart Card" system.

### Key Features
- **Smart Cards**: Visual word cards with Turkish translations, phonetic guides, and syllable breakdown.
- **Pronunciation (TTS)**: Clicking a card triggers a high-quality English pronunciation using the Web Speech API.
- **Spelling Mode (Kodlama)**: Long-pressing a card (0.6s) triggers a letter-by-letter spelling mode (e.g., "R... E... D") to aid in spelling practice.
- **Dynamic Visuals**: Cards pulse and highlight while speaking.

````carousel
![Expanded Word Card](C:\Users\Deacjx\.gemini\antigravity\brain\9884e550-85ac-4cb6-81c0-723b2676e32f\expanded_hello_card_1773992009511.png)
<!-- slide -->
![Long-press Pulse Effect](C:\Users\Deacjx\.gemini\antigravity\brain\9884e550-85ac-4cb6-81c0-723b2676e32f\red_card_pulse_check_1773992257411.png)
<!-- slide -->
![Rich Curriculum JSON Data](C:\Users\Deacjx\.gemini\antigravity\brain\9884e550-85ac-4cb6-81c0-723b2676e32f\api_week_1_json_1773992207660.png)
````

### Validation Summary
- [x] **Data Synchronization**: Verified that [curriculum.json](file:///c:/Users/Deacjx/Documents/English%20code/_learning-plan/curriculum.json) edits are correctly served via the `/api/week` endpoint.
- [x] **Speech Engine**: Confirmed that `SpeechSynthesisUtterance` correctly identifies the text and speaks in `en-US`.
- [x] **Interaction Fidelity**: Long-press detection is localized and prevents default context menus.
- [x] **Compatibility**: Tested across Week 1 (mixed data) and Week 2 (formatted data).

## Interactive Vocabulary Refinement (v3.1)
Based on user feedback, the vocabulary interaction has been further refined for better accessibility and visual feedback.

### Enhancements:
- **Always-Open Card Details**: Turkish meanings, phonetics, and syllables are now visible by default on every card. No additional click is required to see the "Okunuş" and "Heceleme" info.
- **Real-time Spelling Visualizer**: When long-pressing a card for spelling (Kodlama), a large high-contrast letter overlay appears, showing each letter exactly as it is being spoken.
- **Complete Data Population**: Phonics and syllable data have been fully populated for all words in the first two weeks of the curriculum.

